# Bergdb item 001, TouchOK (WPs R3 and R7): a touch that misses a node above a
# touched one. Top node 3 points to root key node 5, which points to 7 and 13;
# 7 points to 15, 13 to 11. T(1) touches 3, 5 and 15, not 7, which is reachable
# with 15 below it. Expected: touchUp fails for node 7; the record and D are the
# model's (the touched nodes get dirty without entries). And the bound of the
# touch (bergdb 024-07): T(1) changes nothing, so no touched node is on a path
# of its change, and touchPath fails for 3, 5 and 15.
TRACE 2
CONFIG touch
TX 0
NEW 0 9 I
NEW 3 8 I
NEW 5 3 I
NEW 7 2 I
NEW 13 2 I
NEW 11 1 I
NEW 15 1 I
ADD 0 0 T 3
ADD 3 0 R 5
ADD 5 0 K 10 7
ADD 5 0 K 20 13
ADD 7 0 K 1 15
ADD 13 0 K 1 11
REC 0 0 0 field 3
VER 3 I
H 0 R 5
F 5 0
VER 5 I
H 0 K 10 7
H 0 K 20 13
F 7 0
F 13 0
VER 7 I
H 0 K 1 15
F 15 0
VER 13 I
H 0 K 1 11
F 11 0
VER 11 I
VER 15 I
DIRTY
END 0
TX 1
TOUCH 3 5 15
REC 1 0 0 field 3
GD 3 5 15
DIRTY 3 1 5 1 15 1
END 1
DONE 1
